{"s":101,"name":"Al-Qari'ah","meaning":"The Calamity","arName":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","type":"Meccan","verses":11,"juz":30,"page":600,"basmala":true,"ayahs":[{"a":1,"ar":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"The Striking Calamity -","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":2,"ar":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"What is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":3,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":4,"ar":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":5,"ar":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":6,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":7,"ar":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","en":"He will be in a pleasant life.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":8,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"But as for one whose scales are light,","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":9,"ar":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","en":"His refuge will be an abyss.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":10,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","en":"And what can make you know what that is?","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":11,"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","juz":30,"page":600}]}